# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Himmat Rakh — environment variables
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Gemini powers two features:
#   1. AI evaluation of written/handwritten exam answers
#   2. The AI doubt solver
#
# Free key (no card needed): https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key below.
#
# Without a key the app still works fully — MCQs are marked
# instantly and offline; only written-answer marking is disabled.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
GEMINI_API_KEY=
